<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Desc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Desc raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney upgraded Desc Sociedad de Fomento Industrial SA de CV to buy from outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
